@dsh-external/llm-degen-heal README · Recovery Conditions / 恢复条件：Recovery resets epoch, cooldown, trigger count, consecutive idle, and lockout — the session returns to full detection sensitivity immediately.

恢复会重置 epoch、冷却、触发计数、连续空转和 lockout——会话立即恢复完整检测灵敏度。

